          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Navštiv tábory Fire Festivalu v Blasted Lands, Eastern Plaguelands, Hinterlands a Searing Gorge, pak si promluv s Festival Flamekeeperem.",
      "title": "Divoké ohně v Eastern Kingdoms",
