          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Flame of Searing Gorge",
          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Visit the Fire Festival camps located in Blasted Lands, Eastern Plaguelands, the Hinterlands and Searing Gorge, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.",
      "title": "Wild Fires in the Eastern Kingdoms",
